From 141f26991d954b61e421e5d4f19fd8723b89e005 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: User-3090 <71881005+User-3090@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 09:51:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix(windows): add managed installer distribution

Add a per-user NSIS distribution with an immutable stable launcher,
versioned runtimes, lease-aware lazy activation, legacy migration, and
strict retryable uninstall ownership. Download and verify the installer
directly for new Windows updates while retaining the portable ZIP for old
immutable clients. Package and test the native boundary with pinned NSIS,
PowerShell 5.1/7, fault injection, exact manifest contracts, and a bounded
kill-on-close installer process job.
